Enhanced Layer 2 Protection

Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers could send fake ARP messages and impersonate gateways or other hosts.

Solution:
Dynamic ARP Inspection validates ARP packets against the DHCP Snooping Binding Table.

Benefit:
Prevents ARP Spoofing and Man-in-the-Middle attacks.

Limitation:
Attackers may still manually configure unauthorized IP addresses.

